OrcaBonsai Ternary Bonsai 2 27B Uncensored — GPU serving recipe
Copyright (c) LeTechLead

This repository is packaging: Dockerfiles, a Compose service and scripts. It bundles
no third-party binaries and no model weights.

It depends on the following upstream work, which is not modified or redistributed here:

  OrcaRouter research team — OrcaBonsai-27B-Uncensored
    Runtime refusal-direction ablation, the refusal direction, the rank-1 LoRA adapter,
    and the original CPU/MLX docker/Dockerfile.
    https://github.com/Continuum-AI-Corp/OrcaBonsai-27B-Uncensored
    License: Apache-2.0

  PrismML — PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp (branch `prism`) and the Ternary Bonsai 2 model
    The fork providing the ternary PQ2_0 (ggml type id 142) kernels, and the ternary
    model weights this recipe serves.
    https://github.com/PrismML-Eng/llama.cpp        License: MIT
    https://huggingface.co/prism-ml/Ternary-Bonsai-2-27B-gguf   License: Apache-2.0

  The adapter file is downloaded from the OrcaBonsai repository at image-build time and
  verified against the sha256 published by that project:
    f1669534803d340a496015f5c45125f3437b4d13ec764f40e34488ce83967f42

  The llama.cpp server is compiled from a pinned tag of the PrismML fork during the
  image build; no binaries are redistributed by this repository.

Model weights are supplied by the user from the upstream public model repository. Users
are responsible for complying with the upstream licences and with applicable law for the
content they generate.
